WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:02.760
This was not done by your son

00:02.840 --> 00:04.240
If possible

00:05.120 --> 00:07.160
Your son is willing to use this life

00:07.240 --> 00:08.907
To exchange for Father's health

00:09.040 --> 00:10.440
Prince

00:10.640 --> 00:12.640
What foolish words are you saying?

00:13.520 --> 00:14.200
I believe you

00:14.280 --> 00:16.040
Wouldn't do such treasonous things

00:16.960 --> 00:18.360
This matter

00:18.840 --> 00:20.800
I will definitely have your father

00:20.880 --> 00:22.280
Investigate thoroughly
